/P 94 0 R
/E (Instead of generating a raw, complex stack trace, the built-in Friendly Error Solver actively analyzes the exact point of failure and interactively prompts the developer with an automated correction proposal in the shell. By asking, "I couldn't quite understand, should I add a ';' at the end and try again? \(Y/N\)", the system attempts to auto-patch the code mid-execution. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
